    },
    {
      "id": "2119647860497227850",
      "text": "Clippers crowd is chanting \"We want DJ!\" to see LAC legend and former All-Star center DeAndre Jordan check into the game, but like many deep-career veterans, he does not enter late in these situations with outcome decided",
      "url": "https://x.com/Jim_Eichenhofer/status/2119647860497227850",
      "published": "2026-11-09T04:26:45+00:00",
      "likes": 5,
      "author": "Jim Eichenhofer",
